:: Robin Hole Story [nobr]
<<effects>>

<<switch _holestory>>
<<case "">>
  "I uhh... found the hole"

  "It was great, you should try it too."
<<case "">>
  "But it made me think, "
  "I feel bad for the monster, being stuck on the other side of the hole. Is it even now just waiting for someone to come and put their ass through the hole?"
<<case "">>
  "I couldn't visit the monster yesterday so today it held onto me longer than usual. I guess it really does get lonely if I don't come by."
<<case "">>
  "For some reason when I visited the monster today it didn't appear. I wonder what it was busy with."
<<case "">>
  "I think I'm pregnant with the monsters baby."
  <<link [[Suggest |]]>><</link>>
<</switch>>



